    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Two chains",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Hangin' off your chest when you kiss me",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "So strange",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Who'd've thought we'd get here with our history?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You know, I tried to be what he thought I was, I wasn't",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I tried to be everythin' I thought he wanted",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And truthfully, I'm so over but stuck on it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And if I'm honest",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I'm still waitin' at the green light",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'd tell you what I feel like, but I can't go",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I'm still tryna make a beeline",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Stuck up in a rewrite of the same song",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Band-Aids and bullet holes don't go",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I can't unhear shit I've been told",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Guess I never healed right",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Maybe it's a green light, but I can't go",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
